    ('NN-QG020','GCT_PLETH intake G036–G040; Q-EFFICIENT/Q-MAP','Do the parameter-restricted positive formulas become uniform PH1 or resolve Howe ranks?','background at statement level; open uniform gate','Original proofs and uniform bit/dimension/construction bounds; actual ranks of specified maps.'),
